+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an RFC 6902 JSON Patch containing `add`, `remove`, `replace`,
+`move`, `copy`, and `test` operations. It returns a new JSON value and never mutates the supplied
+document. Invalid patches and failed operations throw an error.
+
+```ts
+import { applyPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+applyPatch({ items: ["first"] }, [{ op: "add", path: "/items/-", value: "next" }]);
+// { items: ["first", "next"] }
+```
